---
import catalog from '../../labs/catalog.json';
import { Code } from '@astrojs/starlight/components';
import { stepsForLesson, labHref, stepAnchor } from '../lib/lab-steps.mjs';
interface Props { lessonId: string }
const lesson = catalog.lessons.find((row) => row.lessonId === Astro.props.lessonId);
if (!lesson?.implemented) throw new Error(`工作区任务未发行：${Astro.props.lessonId}`);
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const download = `${base}downloads/inventory/${catalog.release}/`;
const start = lesson.startCheckpoint;
const end = lesson.endCheckpoint;
const own = stepsForLesson(lesson.lessonId);
const first = own?.steps[0];
const last = own?.steps.at(-1);
const range = first && last ? (first === last ? `第 ${first.number} 步` : `第 ${first.number}–${last.number} 步`) : '';
const labLink = first ? labHref(base, lesson.labId, stepAnchor(first.stepId)) : labHref(base, lesson.labId);
const titleId = `lesson-task-${lesson.lessonId.toLowerCase()}`;
---
<aside class="lesson-task" aria-labelledby={titleId} data-lesson-task={lesson.lessonId}>
  <div class="task-head">
    <p class="task-title" id={titleId}><strong>本课任务</strong></p>
    <p class="task-links">
      <a href={labLink}>{lesson.labId} 阶段任务{range && ` · ${range}`}</a> · 本课只完成这一项 · <a href={`${base}labs/rules/`}>Lab 规则与验收</a>
    </p>
  </div>
  <dl class="task-facts">
    <div>
      <dt>改动文件</dt>
      <dd><ul class="files">{lesson.files.map((file) => <li><code>{file}</code></li>)}</ul></dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>命令</dt>
      <dd><Code code={`${lesson.commands.start}\n${lesson.commands.dev}\n${lesson.commands.check}`} lang="sh" title="在库存工作区执行" /></dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>本课完成标准</dt>
      <dd><ul class="accept">{lesson.acceptance.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul></dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
  <details class="task-fold">
    <summary>起点、恢复与服务说明</summary>
    <p>接续 {lesson.previousLesson === 'C00' ? '初始骨架' : lesson.previousLesson + ' 的自己的代码'}，在自己的 <code>inventory/</code> 工作区操作；克隆仓库时对应 <code>labs/inventory/</code>。</p>
    <p>跨课沿用正在运行的服务。首次运行或切换界面时启动 dev；切换前用 Ctrl+C 停止旧服务，改完源码再运行 check。</p>
    <p><a href={`${download}${start}.tar.gz`}>下载本课起点（仅补课/恢复）</a> · <a href={`${base}labs/`}>一次安装与恢复说明</a></p>
  </details>
  <details class="task-fold">
    <summary>完整参考解（答案）</summary>
    <p>先保存自己的修改。<a href={`${download}${end}.tar.gz`}>下载本课终点参考解</a>；可运行 <code>{`npm run lab -- compare ${lesson.lessonId}`}</code> 只读比较，不会替换文件。</p>
  </details>
</aside>

<style>
  .lesson-task {
    margin-block: 1.5rem; padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--js-color-primary, var(--sl-color-text-accent));
    border-inline-start-width: 4px;
    border-radius: var(--js-radius, 0.75rem);
    background: var(--js-surface-raised, var(--sl-color-bg-nav));
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  .task-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.25rem 0.85rem; }
  .task-head p { margin: 0; }
  .task-title { font-size: var(--sl-text-lg); }
  .task-links { font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); color: var(--sl-color-gray-2); }
  .task-facts { display: grid; gap: 0.85rem; margin: 0.85rem 0 0; }
  .task-facts > div { min-width: 0; }
  dt { margin: 0 0 0.3rem; font-size: var(--sl-text-xs); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--js-color-primary, var(--sl-color-text-accent)); }
  dd { margin: 0; }
  dd :global(.expressive-code) { margin: 0; }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-inline-start: 1.25rem; }
  li + li { margin-top: 0.25rem; }
  .files { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .files li { margin: 0; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; }
  code { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .task-fold { margin-top: 0.75rem; padding-top: 0.6rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--js-border, var(--sl-color-hairline-light)); }
  .task-fold summary { cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); }
  .task-fold p { margin-block: 0.5rem; font-size: var(--sl-text-sm); }
  a:focus-visible, summary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--js-color-primary, var(--sl-color-text-accent)); outline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
